# MASTER PRODUCT BUILD PROMPT — CAMPUSPILOT AI
## An AI Employee for Coaching Institutes in India

Act as a senior SaaS product designer, UX researcher, full-stack software engineer, AI engineer, database architect, and product strategist.

Build a premium, responsive, production-oriented SaaS web application called **CampusPilot AI**.

This must be a functional software product, not merely a landing page, static dashboard, or UI prototype.

The product's purpose is to act as an AI employee for coaching institutes, tuition centres, competitive-exam academies, and educational training centres in India. It should help these businesses handle student enquiries, answer common questions, qualify leads, manage follow-ups, schedule counselling sessions, and understand their sales performance.

The product should feel like a premium modern SaaS company: elegant, intelligent, trustworthy, fast, and visually polished.

Prioritize a complete, working core experience over a large number of incomplete features.

