# 1. PRODUCT VISION

Build an AI employee that works as a digital admissions assistant for coaching institutes.

The business owner should be able to configure the AI employee once and let it handle repetitive enquiries according to approved information, rules, business hours, and escalation policies.

### Core value proposition

"Never lose a student enquiry because nobody replied or followed up."

### Primary target customers

- JEE and NEET coaching institutes
- UPSC, SSC, banking and government-exam coaching centres
- School tuition centres
- Online education businesses
- Skill-training institutes
- Local educational academies

### Primary users

1. Institute owner or administrator
2. Admissions counsellor
3. Sales or enquiry-management team member

### Core workflow

A prospective student submits an enquiry → the AI responds using approved institute information → asks relevant qualifying questions → creates a lead → assigns a lead status and priority → schedules an appropriate follow-up → books a counselling session when requested → notifies a staff member when human intervention is necessary → tracks the outcome.

The system must never invent course details, fees, available seats, discounts, schedules, or admission guarantees.

