- Disconnected providers are clearly identified.
- Failed API calls display useful errors.
- Live connection status reflects actual provider state.

### UI
- All primary buttons work.
- Forms validate correctly.
- Filters and search work.
- Mobile navigation works.
- Loading, empty, error and success states are present.
- No horizontal overflow occurs on common mobile screen sizes.

